            2026-05-25). Runtime exploit conditions VERIFIED
            ABSENT during QA Checkpoint 9 Phase 5/8 testing — no
            CardDemo controller invokes
            HttpServletResponse.getOutputStream() or sets
            Content-Length directly; all 12 audited endpoints
            return required security headers. Defence in depth:
            ALB ELBSecurityPolicy-TLS13-1-2-2021-06 + AWS WAF
            Web ACL provide network-layer header enforcement.
            Approved by Security Review Board on 2026-05-25.
            Next review 2026-08-25.
        ]]></notes>
        <packageUrl regex="true">^pkg:maven/org\.springframework\.security/spring-security-.*@6\.4\.(?:[0-9]|1[0-4])($|\..*)</packageUrl>
        <cve>CVE-2026-22732</cve>
    </suppress>

